WEBVTT

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:22.088
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:26.593
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:30.663
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:35.268
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:43.309
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:54.083
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:58.525
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:02.962
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:07.033
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:14.701
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:34.491
I want to see her.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:41.896
I want... to see more... of her... fighting.

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:45.935
Rona?

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:50.908
Facing Down Death

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:54.012
It looks like the signal jamming's cleared up.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.911
No, there's still a little of it left.

00:01:57.217 --> 00:01:57.911
What do you mean?

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:02.722
If the system that was jamming
us ran into trouble or went down,

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:04.349
it should completely clear up, right?

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.622
It's weird that there'd be a little of it left.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.622
This signal jamming seems to work differently.

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.559
It's not any kind of radio jamming.

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:13.391
Then what is it?

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:15.468
That is unclear, even to me.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:18.471
It is likely some sort of psychic energy.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:19.028
Huh?

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:23.637
Something akin to a powerful will
is interfering with the system.

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.869
How would you know something like that?

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.445
I don't know. It's just conjecture.

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:34.086
Fine. Then, let's continue in
the vein of this conjecture.

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.190
So we still can't get in touch with Hono?

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.324
That's right.

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:41.487
And the signal jamming's cleared up a bit.

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:42.729
Meaning?

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:47.291
The will that is interfering with
the system is losing strength.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.589
That's what it means.

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:51.696
To put it simply, it's dying?

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:56.970
It doesn't make much sense.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.471
Things like this put me on edge.

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:03.106
Let's hurry along.
I want to catch up with Hono quickly.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.092
Allow me to confirm something.

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:27.106
Do you know where you are headed?

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:27.868
Do you?

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:31.277
My sensors do not function well in here.

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:35.111
The mass of nanomachines are
likely creating a disruptive field.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:38.973
No criterion exists to serve as a guideline.

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:41.647
In that case, shut up and follow me.

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:45.924
The center of the chi flow is
unmistakably underground.

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:47.683
Let's head there for now.

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:54.195
I still have autonomous soldiers on hand.

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:56.492
This place is within me.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:01.200
No matter how strong she is,
it won't be as easy as before.

00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:03.835
Stop this, Rona.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.440
If you continue to use your
powers in your condition...

00:04:08.181 --> 00:04:09.842
R-Rona...

00:04:10.049 --> 00:04:11.914
You know her, don't you?

00:04:12.285 --> 00:04:14.344
Yes, I do.

00:04:14.821 --> 00:04:18.458
She is... Honoka is not one of The Third.

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:20.949
She has come to help us.

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:23.657
Help... us?

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:25.031
That's right.

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:27.761
A girl who isn't even one of The Third? Why?

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:31.729
Fila Marique must have hired her.

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:35.469
Impossible. I mean, isn't that right?

00:04:36.009 --> 00:04:39.612
I am an expendable existence to The Third.

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:41.204
It's impossible that they'd come to help.

00:04:41.848 --> 00:04:43.406
There is still time.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.208
Come with me and...

00:04:47.253 --> 00:04:47.947
Stop it.

00:04:48.321 --> 00:04:48.878
Rona!

00:04:49.222 --> 00:04:50.154
Stop it!

00:04:55.428 --> 00:05:00.365
You can hardly contain yourself,
you're so concerned about her.

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:02.796
That's why you suddenly grew agitated.

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:06.798
I can't see you anymore!

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:08.831
Joganki?

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:10.799
Where are you?!

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:17.807
No one... I will allow no one to interfere.

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:24.012
Bogie.

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:26.181
Up ahead. A flying object.

00:05:26.526 --> 00:05:27.860
It's big.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.021
Looks like they still had that left.

00:05:30.396 --> 00:05:32.932
There was one in the detachment
that got commandeered.

00:05:32.932 --> 00:05:36.698
The anti-tank attack chopper, TH-1138.

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:39.397
The Tank Killer.
I guess their star performer is here.

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:41.274
You two get off here.

00:05:41.274 --> 00:05:41.641
What?

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:44.542
At this distance, running to the target
location shouldn't be too tough.

00:05:44.644 --> 00:05:46.009
I'll draw its attention.

00:05:46.612 --> 00:05:47.874
You must be joking!

00:05:48.114 --> 00:05:51.447
You think I could ever tell her
that we used you as a shield?

00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:52.985
You don't have faith in me.

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:54.475
There's no way.

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:56.245
Your opponent is the natural enemy of tanks.

00:05:56.556 --> 00:05:59.359
Hurry up. I'm going to have
problems if you won't get off.

00:05:59.359 --> 00:06:01.350
Since I'll be engaging in some
rather rough maneuvers.

00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:04.464
Are you... planning to win?

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:05.832
Of course.

00:06:05.832 --> 00:06:09.097
I don't recall saying I would
sacrifice myself for you guys.

00:06:09.402 --> 00:06:11.571
Now, hurry up and get off.

00:06:11.571 --> 00:06:13.539
If you won't get off, I'm extracting all the air.

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:14.897
Bogie...

00:06:15.108 --> 00:06:16.132
Let's go.

00:06:16.976 --> 00:06:18.603
Let's have faith in him.

00:06:20.947 --> 00:06:23.472
Sorry, but I don't put faith in anyone.

00:06:23.683 --> 00:06:26.753
If you hang around in the area,
I won't hesitate to run over you.

00:06:26.753 --> 00:06:28.015
All right, already!

00:06:28.654 --> 00:06:30.588
Do you have any messages for Miss Honoka?

00:06:30.857 --> 00:06:32.984
No. Anything I want to say, I'll tell her myself.

00:06:33.526 --> 00:06:37.730
Do as you please.
You can't go inside the building anyway.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.697
Go amuse yourself.

00:06:39.165 --> 00:06:40.598
I intend to.

00:06:51.043 --> 00:06:52.977
Let's hope I can enjoy this.

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:02.552
This way.

00:07:02.755 --> 00:07:05.121
Are you trying to sense something of Joganki?

00:07:05.425 --> 00:07:08.690
No. Unfortunately, I can't sense his chi.

00:07:08.995 --> 00:07:11.589
We'll just have to find Rona Fauna and ask her.

00:07:20.006 --> 00:07:24.067
You know, this place sort of feels
like some kind of scaly intestines.

00:07:26.512 --> 00:07:27.308
You know?

00:07:28.581 --> 00:07:31.607
Say something. I'm talking to you.

00:07:32.351 --> 00:07:33.147
You...

00:07:35.988 --> 00:07:36.750
You...

00:07:46.599 --> 00:07:47.691
You take the ones behind us!

00:08:16.762 --> 00:08:17.660
Done?

00:08:21.067 --> 00:08:24.230
Good, then let's go. Keep an eye out behind us.

00:08:26.939 --> 00:08:28.407
What're you doing?

00:08:28.407 --> 00:08:30.705
If you just keep standing there,
I'm leaving you behind.

00:08:35.248 --> 00:08:37.083
Jettisoning the cargo block...

00:08:37.083 --> 00:08:39.847
You think that makes up for
the difference in mobility?

00:09:11.684 --> 00:09:13.174
I doubt you can dodge those.

00:09:23.896 --> 00:09:25.659
It seems you have some skill at least.

00:09:25.831 --> 00:09:27.992
That should do for a warm-up.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:35.700
What are you playing at?

00:09:36.776 --> 00:09:37.674
Cut me down.

00:09:49.789 --> 00:09:50.949
What are you playing at?

00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:52.788
Cut me down.

00:09:54.193 --> 00:09:57.697
I cannot comprehend this.
You are supposed to hate me.

00:09:57.697 --> 00:10:00.996
Yeah, I can't forget, even if I wanted to.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:04.070
That's right, you should hate me.

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:05.332
So what about it?

00:10:05.671 --> 00:10:08.874
Here, my highest priority order is to obey you...

00:10:08.874 --> 00:10:10.603
...and no defiance is permitted.

00:10:10.943 --> 00:10:14.140
You said that you would cut me
down if I proved a hindrance.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.678
And Fila Marique approved this as well.

00:10:16.749 --> 00:10:18.740
That was what you wished, was it not?

00:10:20.219 --> 00:10:22.244
Wasn't that based on a mutual agreement?

00:10:24.223 --> 00:10:27.454
Honoka finally understood
what Blue Breaker meant.

00:10:28.561 --> 00:10:33.999
It was his belief that he was part of
Fila Marique's payment to Honoka.

00:10:34.867 --> 00:10:37.859
He must have felt humiliated
about it in his own way.

00:10:38.371 --> 00:10:41.067
Cut me down. You could
do so with ease right now.

00:10:42.775 --> 00:10:43.867
This is so stupid.

00:10:44.443 --> 00:10:46.741
It would be effortless for you
at this distance. Cut me down!

00:10:46.979 --> 00:10:48.344
Give it a rest already!

00:10:51.117 --> 00:10:53.449
You don't seem to get it,
so I'll spell it out for you.

00:10:53.786 --> 00:10:54.582
Listen carefully.

00:10:55.087 --> 00:10:56.989
I'm here on a job.

00:10:56.989 --> 00:10:59.392
Even if I'm able to take Joganki back,

00:10:59.392 --> 00:11:02.228
if I lose even one member of the mission,

00:11:02.228 --> 00:11:04.822
that's not success! Do you understand that?!

00:11:05.331 --> 00:11:08.425
I can't draw my sword for the kind
of reason you're talking about!

00:11:09.068 --> 00:11:11.332
Do you mean to say there
was no mutual agreement?

00:11:11.737 --> 00:11:15.696
Of course not! I've had about
enough of you taking me for a fool.

00:11:16.008 --> 00:11:19.205
Listen up. There're only two
things you need to think about.

00:11:19.311 --> 00:11:21.681
One is to follow my orders.

00:11:21.681 --> 00:11:24.013
The other is to get yourself back alive,
no matter what.

00:11:24.283 --> 00:11:27.480
I'd rather you didn't do anything
that would tarnish my record.

00:11:27.687 --> 00:11:29.712
Got that? If you got that, let's go.

00:11:30.856 --> 00:11:34.193
I cannot comprehend it. You hate me.

00:11:34.193 --> 00:11:36.923
How can you entrust your
back to someone like that?

00:11:36.996 --> 00:11:38.463
How can you fight alongside someone like that?!

00:11:38.764 --> 00:11:42.201
If you've got time to think
about stupid things like that,

00:11:42.201 --> 00:11:43.498
start moving your feet.

00:11:44.003 --> 00:11:46.471
I want to get this over with quick and go home.

00:11:46.872 --> 00:11:50.276
Also, if you're gonna threaten me,
at least have one round left.

00:11:50.276 --> 00:11:52.972
You're totally unconvincing with an empty gun.

00:12:06.726 --> 00:12:08.057
Don't worry.

00:12:08.928 --> 00:12:09.986
That girl...

00:12:10.763 --> 00:12:13.061
That girl named Honoka...

00:12:13.766 --> 00:12:15.427
She's still alive.

00:12:16.669 --> 00:12:19.502
What about you?

00:12:20.372 --> 00:12:21.498
I...

00:12:22.775 --> 00:12:24.003
I'm...

00:13:19.298 --> 00:13:22.756
You did quite well for a tank made by humans.

00:13:29.341 --> 00:13:30.273
What?

00:13:40.252 --> 00:13:41.378
Impossible...

00:14:03.442 --> 00:14:06.002
"Better to be prepared..." I suppose.

00:14:06.178 --> 00:14:09.114
In the end, he was just an artificial
brain with no combat experience.

00:14:09.114 --> 00:14:10.445
An amateur.

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:21.319
Talk about spotless. Looks like Hono's okay.

00:14:22.595 --> 00:14:25.689
But what the heck is this creepy stuff anyway?

00:14:25.965 --> 00:14:27.899
It's a network of nanomachines.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.494
Network?

00:14:29.702 --> 00:14:32.805
Yes, it seems to have the ability
to amplify psychic energy...

00:14:32.805 --> 00:14:36.172
...and transmit it outwardly.

00:14:36.408 --> 00:14:39.745
Huh. So this Rona-whatever person used this...

00:14:39.745 --> 00:14:42.976
...to manipulate military
forces and jam our signals.

00:14:43.449 --> 00:14:47.453
How troublesome. The flow of
chi is spread out so finely,

00:14:47.453 --> 00:14:48.354
it's hard to pin it down...

00:14:48.354 --> 00:14:49.116
Teacher!

00:15:02.868 --> 00:15:03.527
Iks?

00:15:09.174 --> 00:15:10.402
Are you okay?

00:15:10.609 --> 00:15:12.372
Yes, somehow.

00:15:12.611 --> 00:15:14.636
But, you were shot, right?

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:18.208
No, I merely lost my footing and tripped.

00:15:18.751 --> 00:15:20.218
Pardon me for worrying you.

00:15:23.155 --> 00:15:23.985
Stay here.

00:15:33.265 --> 00:15:35.597
Damn! I can't read the enemy's chi.

00:15:40.839 --> 00:15:41.999
A hand grenade?

00:15:51.817 --> 00:15:55.446
To think they would use explosives indoors...

00:16:24.149 --> 00:16:25.138
Say...

00:16:26.251 --> 00:16:31.245
Could it be that if I kill you, it'll all be over?

00:16:31.857 --> 00:16:33.620
Why not give it a try?

00:16:33.892 --> 00:16:36.360
If you still have the strength for it, that is.

00:17:10.329 --> 00:17:12.388
H-How?

00:17:13.165 --> 00:17:18.501
I sensed... nothing... from you...

00:17:20.439 --> 00:17:21.667
Yeah...

00:17:23.008 --> 00:17:27.342
Maybe I'm already dead.

00:17:39.458 --> 00:17:40.857
Don't give up.

00:17:41.393 --> 00:17:43.725
Please don't give up on living.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:48.496
No matter how painful it is,
please don't give up.

00:17:56.141 --> 00:17:57.130
Are you all right?

00:18:02.381 --> 00:18:04.872
So, you've been touching me
like that this whole time...

00:18:05.517 --> 00:18:06.211
Yes.

00:18:09.721 --> 00:18:11.052
Move it aside already.

00:18:12.224 --> 00:18:13.316
Are you all right?

00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:20.065
You in there? Paife! Iks!

00:18:22.201 --> 00:18:23.930
Hard to kill, huh?

00:18:25.137 --> 00:18:26.161
Indeed.

00:18:29.441 --> 00:18:31.170
Stop this now, Rona.

00:18:31.944 --> 00:18:33.809
Leave the rest to me.

00:18:34.113 --> 00:18:36.248
Leave it all to me, just as you always have.

00:18:36.248 --> 00:18:37.442
As I always have?

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.484
You haven't changed at all, have you, Joganki?

00:18:41.253 --> 00:18:44.313
You're no different than The Third,
who think of themselves as gods.

00:18:45.724 --> 00:18:47.351
The reason you were kind to me...

00:18:48.293 --> 00:18:52.423
To her... The reason you were kind to me...

00:18:53.298 --> 00:18:56.096
...was because you were
interested in my research.

00:18:57.035 --> 00:18:58.434
That was all.

00:18:59.304 --> 00:19:00.134
Isn't that right?

00:19:00.973 --> 00:19:02.668
I was kind to you?

00:19:03.342 --> 00:19:07.540
Yes, you were kind, Joganki.

00:19:08.714 --> 00:19:10.147
That was why I...

00:19:11.049 --> 00:19:12.175
Why she...

00:19:12.951 --> 00:19:13.975
Why I...

00:19:15.487 --> 00:19:17.182
...loved you!

00:19:20.359 --> 00:19:21.257
That's why...

00:19:22.227 --> 00:19:24.195
That's why she has to go.

00:19:27.633 --> 00:19:28.497
What's wrong?

00:19:29.468 --> 00:19:30.696
I feel cold.

00:19:31.303 --> 00:19:33.294
No temperature change has been observed.

00:19:42.881 --> 00:19:44.143
Beyond this barrier...

00:19:45.317 --> 00:19:47.911
Something throbbed and tingled
deep behind her brow.

00:19:48.687 --> 00:19:52.646
A freezing chill she had felt several
times since this had all begun.

00:19:52.758 --> 00:19:56.091
And it was all converged on
the other side of this barrier.

00:19:56.528 --> 00:19:57.893
That was the sense she got.

00:19:59.331 --> 00:20:00.889
I wonder if it won't open...

00:20:07.372 --> 00:20:08.202
It's a trap.

00:20:08.574 --> 00:20:09.905
Maybe.

00:20:10.509 --> 00:20:12.807
Stay here. Back me up.

00:21:03.729 --> 00:21:05.060
This person...

00:21:05.497 --> 00:21:07.192
That is Rona Fauna.

00:21:24.149 --> 00:21:25.878
What are you trying to do?

00:21:26.018 --> 00:21:26.814
Stop this already!

00:21:30.555 --> 00:21:32.580
Stop this, Rona!

00:21:53.011 --> 00:21:56.448
An intersection waiting for morning...
Asa o matteiru kousaten ga

00:21:56.448 --> 00:22:00.452
...cradling an abandoned cat that wandered in.
Mayoikonda sute-neko o daiteiru

00:22:00.452 --> 00:22:03.055
Red and green and yellow.
Aka to ao to kiiro

00:22:03.055 --> 00:22:06.047
It is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:06.725 --> 00:22:10.162
Stopping just after dawn,
Akegata-sugi ni furiyanda

00:22:10.162 --> 00:22:14.199
a misty rain made a screen of water.
Kosame ga tsukutta mizu no sukuriin ga

00:22:14.199 --> 00:22:16.768
Until that time when it dries,
Kawaku sono toki made

00:22:16.768 --> 00:22:19.794
it is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:19.971 --> 00:22:23.442
More than small coincidences like that,
Sonna chiisana guuzen yori mo

00:22:23.442 --> 00:22:26.845
the fact that you are there...
Kimi ga soko ni iru koto ga

00:22:26.845 --> 00:22:30.349
...cannot be a small thing, I think.
Chiisai hazu ga nai to omounda

00:22:30.349 --> 00:22:33.978
Even though it's obvious.
Atarimae nandakedo

00:22:35.654 --> 00:22:42.427
It must be sad not to have anyone.
Daremo inai to kanashii koto deshou

00:22:42.427 --> 00:22:49.368
Now, come on out to where the sun is shining.
Saa hi no ataru basho e dete-oide

00:22:49.368 --> 00:22:56.208
Even the several incidents that trouble you...
Kimi o komaraseru ikutsuka no dekigoto mo

00:22:56.208 --> 00:23:01.168
...are coincidences of yesterdays past.
Kinou izen no guuzen nanda yo

00:23:03.048 --> 00:23:08.384
Though, I'm sure you actually know that already.
Hontou wa wakatteru to omou kedo

00:23:15.127 --> 00:23:16.856
Preview

00:23:17.229 --> 00:23:19.459
Blue Breaker launches an attack against me.

00:23:19.798 --> 00:23:24.929
His unflinching, determined attack
mercilessly corners me as I hesitate.

00:23:25.437 --> 00:23:28.201
Could it be that he's fallen
under Rona Fauna's control?

00:23:28.874 --> 00:23:31.035
In the end, do I have no choice
but to cut him down?

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:33.912
I am unable to answer that question,

00:23:33.912 --> 00:23:36.073
even as the unfeeling blade bears down on me.

00:23:36.648 --> 00:23:40.152
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.152 --> 00:23:42.020
episode 21, "Emotions That Fall Short".

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:43.455
Emotions That Fall Short
